{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12318","headline":"送集贤崔八叔承恩括图书 · 钱起","name":"送集贤崔八叔承恩括图书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨露满儒服，天心知子虚。\n还劳五经笥，更访百家书。\n赠别倾文苑，光华比使车。\n晚云随客散，寒树出关疎。\n相见应朝夕，归期在玉除。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12318.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12318","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}